WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Welcome to AI Implementation. I’m Brian Kennedy Jr.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.320
This introduction will help you put the workbook

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.040
to use. You will work toward a current-workflow

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.400
review, a bounded tool trial and a human-reviewed

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.680
implementation plan. Start with one work task and

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.560
its current result. Define the information the tool

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.280
may use, the quality check and the action

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.200
that requires human approval before introducing automation. Choose

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.520
a real situation you can work on privately,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.720
or use a clearly labeled fictional example. You

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.440
can write, speak your response or use another

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.400
accessible format. As you work, keep a record

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.560
of what you tried, what you noticed and

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.280
what you changed. The useful result is a

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.440
tested, privacy-aware workflow specification, with enough detail that

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.160
you can explain your next step. No confidential

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:54.160
uploads, security/compliance certification, guaranteed ninety-day outcome or unapproved

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.440
outbound actions. Begin with the starting reflection in

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.240
your workbook. Name the decision or practice you

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.640
want help with, set a review date, and

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.080
open the first exercise.
